# 🏎️ F1 Race Intelligence

A production-style data engineering project that extracts, transforms, validates, and loads Formula 1 race data into a cloud-hosted PostgreSQL database for analytics and visualization.

This project demonstrates modern data engineering practices including ETL pipelines, relational database design, cloud databases, automated validation, and API-ready architecture.

---

## 🚀 Features

- Extracts official Formula 1 session data using the FastF1 API
- Cleans and transforms raw race and lap telemetry
- Validates datasets before loading
- Loads data into a normalized PostgreSQL database
- Uses UPSERT operations to prevent duplicate records
- Tracks every pipeline execution
- Supports cloud deployment using Neon PostgreSQL
- Built with scalability in mind for future API and dashboard integration

---

