## ▶️ Running the Pipeline

Run a race by specifying the season and event name.

```bash
python -m pipeline.run_pipeline --season 2025 --event Monza
```

Example:

```bash
python -m pipeline.run_pipeline --season 2024 --event Bahrain
```

